    --kiw--product-finder-form-allentown-finder-gap: var(--space-xxl);
  }
  /*
   * Form Embed tuning for the Figma question (Radio Button Framed=yes, stacked full width): its documented variables only.
   * Figma's question is text-xl, but FormEmbed's label size also sizes the framed options (Figma text-l, 52 px), so it stays text-l.
